#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L82
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:82
msgid ""
"A Document Signer utilizes the private key of a private-public key pair to "
"digitally sign Verifiable Digital Health Certificates.  A single private key"
" is expected to sign a large quantity of Verifiable Digital Health "
"Certificates. The corresponding public key is referred to as a Document "
"Signer Certificate (DSC)."
msgstr ""
"Un firmante de documentos utiliza la clave privada de un par de claves "
"pública-privada para firmar digitalmente Certificados digitales de salud "
"verificables.  Se prevé que una misma clave privada firme una gran cantidad "
"de Certificados digitales de salud verificables. La clave pública "
"correspondiente se denomina certificado de firmante de documentos (DSC)."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L49
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:49
msgid ""
"A formal application sent via a verifiable and secure channel from an "
"Eligible GDHCN Participant to the GDHCN Secretariat to join the GDHCN Trust "
"Network and participate within a particular Trust Domain."
msgstr ""
"Solicitud oficial enviada por un medio verificable y seguro por un "
"Participante cualificado para la GDHCN a la Secretaría de la GDHCN con el "
"fin de incorporarse a la Red de confianza de la GDHCN y participar en un "
"Ámbito de confianza determinado."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L19
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:19
msgid ""
"a fund, programme, specialized agency, or related organization within the UN"
" system; or"
msgstr ""
"un fondo, programa, organismo especializado u organización conexa del "
"sistema de las Naciones Unidas; o"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L12
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:12
msgid ""
"A GDHCN Participant is participant of the Trust Network that adheres to the "
"Terms of Participation and manages the necessary technical infrastructure "
"and governance processes. GDHCN Participants are responsible for making "
"bilateral determinations related to the utilization of Trusted Services."
msgstr ""
"Un Participante en la GDHCN es un participante de la red de confianza que se"
" atiene a las Condiciones de participación y gestiona la infraestructura "
"técnica y los procesos de gobernanza necesarios. Los Participantes en la "
"GDHCN son responsables de adoptar determinaciones bilaterales relativas a la"
" utilización de los Servicios de confianza."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L122
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:122
msgid ""
"A GDHCN Participant's Backend System for managing the local part of "
"information. The implementation of GDHCN Participant's Backend System is not"
" in the scope of this document. A national backend can be also understood as"
" a trusted party on-boarded in the Trust Network Gateway (can be a script, a"
" proxy or a web server as well)."
msgstr ""
"Sistema de back-end del Participante en la GDHCN para gestionar la parte "
"local de la información. La implementación del sistema de back-end del "
"Participante en la GDHCN no entra en el ámbito del presente documento. Un "
"sistema de back-end nacional también puede entenderse como una parte de "
"confianza integrada en la puerta de enlace a la red de confianza (también "
"puede ser un script, un proxy o un servidor web)."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L73
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:73
msgid ""
"A Holder is an individual that has Verifiable Digtial Health Certificate in "
"their possesion, received from an Issuer.  The Holder may choose to share "
"the Verifiable Digital Health Certificate with a Receiver."
msgstr ""
"Un titular es una persona que tiene en su poder un Certificado digital de "
"salud verificable recibido de un emisor.  El titular puede optar por "
"compartir el Certificado digital de salud verificable con un receptor."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L76
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:76
msgid ""
"A Reciever is a system authorized by a Trust Network Participant to receive "
"from a Holder a Veritifable verify, and utilize the content within."
msgstr ""
"Un receptor es un sistema autorizado por un Participante en la red de "
"confianza para recibir de un titular un Certificado digital de salud "
"verificable, verificarlo y utilizar su contenido."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L144
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:144
msgid ""
"A service (digital or otherwise) related to the issuance, management, "
"verification, exchange, or other relevant processes, of Verifiable Digital "
"Health Certificates which is defined using open, interoperable digital "
"health standards."
msgstr ""
"Servicio (digital o de otro tipo) relacionado con la expedición, la gestión,"
" la verificación, el intercambio u otros procesos pertinentes de "
"Certificados digitales de salud verificables, que se define mediante normas "
"de salud digital abiertas e interoperables."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L94
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:94
msgid ""
"a set of policy and regulatory standards describing expected behavior of "
"GDHCN Participants in relation to operation of the Trusted Services and "
"utilization of Verifiable Digital Health Certificates (e.g. data "
"minimization, privacy, scope of use)."
msgstr ""
"un conjunto de normas de política y reglamentarias que describen el "
"comportamiento que se espera de los Participantes en la GDHCN en relación "
"con el funcionamiento de los Servicios de confianza y la utilización de "
"Certificados digitales de salud verificables (por ejemplo, minimización de "
"datos, privacidad, ámbito de uso)."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L17
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:17
msgid ""
"a State Party recognized by the International Health Regulations, or sub-"
"national unit thereof;"
msgstr ""
"un Estado Parte reconocido por el Reglamento Sanitario Internacional, o una "
"unidad subnacional de este;"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L140
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:140
msgid ""
"A system utilized by a GDHCN Participant to verify the digital signature of "
"a Verifiable Digital Health Certificate."
msgstr ""
"Sistema utilizado por un Participante en la GDHCN para verificar la firma "
"digital de un Certificado digital de salud verificable."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L91
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:91
msgid "A Trust Domain consists of:"
msgstr "Un Ámbito de confianza consta de:"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L106
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:106
msgid ""
"A Trust Network is a means to authenticate the encryption public keys used "
"by participants within a network to perform encryption services, verify "
"digital signatures, establish secure connections between systems, and "
"otherwise make use of encryption public keys."
msgstr ""
"Una red de confianza es un medio para autenticar las claves públicas de "
"cifrado utilizadas por los participantes de una red para prestar servicios "
"de cifrado, verificar firmas digitales, establecer conexiones seguras entre "
"sistemas y hacer cualquier otro uso de claves públicas de cifrado."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L16
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:16
msgid "a WHO Member State or Associate Member, or sub-national unit thereof;"
msgstr ""
"un Estado Miembro o Miembro Asociado de la OMS, o una unidad subnacional de "
"este;"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L15
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:15
msgid "An Eligible GDHCN Participant is one of the following:"
msgstr "Un Participante cualificado para la GDHCN es uno de los siguientes:"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L79
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:79
msgid ""
"An Issuer a system authorized by a Trust Network Participant to generate "
"Verifiable Digital Health Certificates which are provided to a Holder.   An "
"Issuer is responsible for generating the content that is digitally signed "
"within the Verifiable Digital Health Certificate.   In order to sign this "
"content, an Issuer should either itself be a Document Signer or utilize a "
"Document Signer service, as authorized by the jurisdicitonal policy."
msgstr ""
"Un emisor es un sistema autorizado por un Participante en la red de "
"confianza para generar Certificados digitales de salud verificables que se "
"proporcionan a un titular.   El emisor es responsable de generar el "
"contenido que se firma digitalmente dentro del Certificado digital de salud "
"verificable.   Para firmar este contenido, el emisor debería ser él mismo un"
" firmante de documentos o utilizar un servicio de firmante de documentos, "
"según lo autorice la política de la jurisdicción."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L20
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:20
msgid ""
"an organization officially delegated by one of the organizations mentioned "
"above that can abide by the GDHCN Terms of Participation and fulfils one or "
"more of the following health service functions:"
msgstr ""
"una organización delegada oficialmente por una de las organizaciones "
"mencionadas anteriormente que pueda cumplir las Condiciones de participación"
" en la GDHCN y desempeñe una o varias de las siguientes funciones de "
"servicios de salud:"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L55
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:55
msgid ""
"An organization or organizational unit that is responsible for establishing "
"and/or implementing procedures for accreditation of health professions "
"education institutions.  See "
"https://apps.who.int/iris/rest/bitstreams/1473223/retrieve and "
"https://applications.emro.who.int/docs/emrc50r9_en.pdf?ua=1"
msgstr ""
"Organización o unidad orgánica responsable de establecer o aplicar, o ambas "
"cosas, los procedimientos de acreditación de las instituciones de formación "
"de profesionales de la salud.  Véanse "
"https://apps.who.int/iris/rest/bitstreams/1473223/retrieve y "
"https://applications.emro.who.int/docs/emrc50r9_en.pdf?ua=1"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L58
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:58
msgid ""
"An organization or organizational unit that is responsible for establishing "
"and/or implementing procedures for licensure, and the licensing of "
"organizations or individuals to provide clinical, health system or public "
"health services within their jurisdiction. Licensing comprises processes "
"through which duly authorized governmental authorities, such as recognized "
"professional organizations, grant permission to an individual or healthcare "
"organization to operate or engage in a medical occupation or profession. "
"See: https://apps.who.int/iris/rest/bitstreams/1473223/retrieve and "
"https://cdn.who.int/media/docs/default-source/documents/health-systems-"
"strengthening-glossary.pdf."
msgstr ""
"Organización o unidad orgánica responsable de establecer o aplicar, o ambas "
"cosas, los procedimientos de concesión de licencias, así como de habilitar a"
" organizaciones o personas para prestar servicios clínicos, del sistema de "
"salud o de salud pública en su jurisdicción. La habilitación comprende los "
"procesos mediante los cuales las autoridades gubernamentales debidamente "
"autorizadas, como las organizaciones profesionales reconocidas, otorgan a "
"una persona o a una organización de atención de salud el permiso para operar"
" o ejercer una ocupación o profesión médica. Véanse: "
"https://apps.who.int/iris/rest/bitstreams/1473223/retrieve y "
"https://cdn.who.int/media/docs/default-source/documents/health-systems-"
"strengthening-glossary.pdf."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L61
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:61
msgid ""
"An organization, or organizational unit, that is responsible for "
"establishing procedures for and/or implementation of activities related to "
"the protection, promotion, and improvement of public health within a "
"specific jurisdiction or domain. May also be referred to as a Ministry of "
"Health, Department of Health, or Public Health Authority."
msgstr ""
"Organización, o unidad orgánica, responsable de establecer procedimientos "
"para las actividades relacionadas con la protección, la promoción y la "
"mejora de la salud pública en una jurisdicción o ámbito específico, o de "
"llevar a cabo dichas actividades, o ambas cosas. También puede denominarse "
"Ministerio de Salud, Departamento de Salud o autoridad de salud pública."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L64
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:64
msgid ""
"An organization, or organizational unit, that is responsible for "
"establishing procedures for and/or implementing required activities, both "
"proactive and reactive, for minimizing the danger and impact of acute public"
" health events that endanger people’s health across geographical regions and"
" international boundaries.  See: https://www.who.int/health-topics/health-"
"security."
msgstr ""
"Organización, o unidad orgánica, responsable de establecer procedimientos "
"para las actividades necesarias, tanto proactivas como reactivas, para "
"reducir al mínimo el peligro y las repercusiones de los eventos agudos de "
"salud pública que ponen en peligro la salud de las personas en distintas "
"regiones geográficas y a través de las fronteras internacionales, o de "
"llevar a cabo dichas actividades, o ambas cosas.  Véase: "
"https://www.who.int/health-topics/health-security."

