"Trust Network Participant - Document Signing Certificate Authority  "
"(TNPDSCA)"
msgstr ""
"Participante en la red de confianza - Autoridad de certificación de firma de"
" documentos  (TNPDSCA)"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
