msgid ""
"Uploaded data packages are provided by the TNG “as is”, meaning that the TNG"
" does not add or delete DSCs from the packages it receives. The Backend "
"systems of the GDHCN Participants shall be enabled to verify the end-to-end "
"integrity and authenticity of the uploaded data (see Section \"Integrity and"
" authenticity of uploaded data\")."
msgstr ""
