#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md#L31
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md:31
msgid ""
"The embedded type of trustlist carries the key material directly within the "
"DID documents' verificationMethod property and supports immediate "
"verification. On the root level it contains all keys imported from the trust"
" network gateway (TNG)."
msgstr ""
"El tipo incrustado de lista de confianza lleva el material de claves "
"directamente en la propiedad verificationMethod de los documentos DID y "
"permite la verificación inmediata. En el nivel raíz contiene todas las "
"claves importadas de la puerta de enlace a la red de confianza (TNG)."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md#L55
