#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md#L3
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md:3
msgid ""
"This specification describes the publication of Global Digital Health "
"Certification Network (GDHCN) key material as Decentralized Identifier (DID)"
" documents. DIDs are specified by the W3C DID Core Specification. The DID "
"concept summarizes the core drivers and usage of the DID format in scope of "
"GDHCN."
msgstr ""
"En esta especificación se describe la publicación del material de claves de "
"la Red Mundial de Certificación Digital de Salud (GDHCN) como documentos de "
"identificadores descentralizados (DID). Los DID se especifican en la W3C DID"
" Core Specification. El concepto de DID resume los principales motores y "
"usos del formato DID en el ámbito de la GDHCN."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md#L64
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md:64
msgid ""
"tng-cdn-who.int/v2/trustlist/-/- matches key material for all $domains and "
"all $participants without filtering a specific $usage type so the did.json "
"may contain SCA and DSC keys."
msgstr ""
"tng-cdn-who.int/v2/trustlist/-/- coincide con el material de claves de todos"
" los $domains y todos los $participants sin filtrar ningún tipo de $usage "
"específico, por lo que el did.json puede contener claves SCA y DSC."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md#L70
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md:70
msgid ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist-ref/$domain/$partcipant/did.json contains all "
"key $usage type level DID document references as DID id for the selected "
"$domain and $participant."
msgstr ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist-ref/$domain/$partcipant/did.json contiene todas"
" las referencias a documentos DID del nivel de tipo de $usage de clave, como"
" identificadores DID, para el $domain y el $participant seleccionados."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md#L71
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md:71
msgid ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist-ref/$domain/$participant/$usage/did.json "
"contains a reference to a DID the embedded trustlist that correlates to the "
"selected $domain, $participant and key $usage type and that contains the key"
" material."
msgstr ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist-ref/$domain/$participant/$usage/did.json "
"contiene una referencia a un DID de la lista de confianza incrustada que "
"corresponde al $domain, al $participant y al tipo de $usage de clave "
"seleccionados y que contiene el material de claves."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md#L69
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md:69
msgid ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist-ref/$domain/did.json contains all $participant "
"level DID document references as DID id for the given $domain."
msgstr ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist-ref/$domain/did.json contiene todas las "
"referencias a documentos DID del nivel $participant, como identificadores "
"DID, para el $domain dado."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md#L68
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md:68
msgid ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist-ref/did.json contains all DID document "
"references of the next sub-level as DID id."
msgstr ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist-ref/did.json contiene todas las referencias a "
"documentos DID del subnivel siguiente, como identificadores DID."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md#L60
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md:60
msgid ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist/$domain/$participant/$usage/did.json matches "
"all keys for a specific key $usage type for a given $domain AND "
"$participant."
msgstr ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist/$domain/$participant/$usage/did.json coincide "
"con todas las claves de un tipo de $usage de clave específico para un "
"$domain Y un $participant dados."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md#L58
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md:58
msgid ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist/$domain/$participant/did.json matches all key "
"$usage types for a specific $domain AND $participant."
msgstr ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist/$domain/$participant/did.json coincide con "
"todos los tipos de $usage de clave para un $domain Y un $participant "
"específicos."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md#L63
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md:63
msgid ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist/$domain/-/$usage/did.json matches keys for all "
"$participants of a specific $domain filtered by there key $usage type."
msgstr ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist/$domain/-/$usage/did.json coincide con las "
"claves de todos los $participants de un $domain específico, filtradas por su"
" tipo de $usage de clave."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md#L62
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md:62
msgid ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist/-/$participant/$usage/did.json matches keys or "
"references in all $domains for a specific $participant and specific key "
"$usage type."
msgstr ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist/-/$participant/$usage/did.json coincide con las"
" claves o referencias de todos los $domains para un $participant específico "
"y un tipo de $usage de clave específico."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md#L59
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md:59
msgid ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist/-/$participant/did.json matches all key $usage "
"types across all $domains for a specific $participant."
msgstr ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist/-/$participant/did.json coincide con todos los "
"tipos de $usage de clave de todos los $domains para un $participant "
"específico."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md#L61
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md:61
msgid ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist/-/$participant/did.json matches key material or"
" references for all $domains for a specific $participant without filtering "
"the key usage types."
msgstr ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist/-/$participant/did.json coincide con el "
"material de claves o las referencias de todos los $domains para un "
"$participant específico, sin filtrar los tipos de uso de la clave."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md#L57
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_did_gdhcn.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did_gdhcn.md:57
msgid ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist/did.json matches all keys for all $domains, "
"$participants and key $usage types."
msgstr ""
"tng-cdn.who.int/v2/trustlist/did.json coincide con todas las claves de todos"
" los $domains, $participants y tipos de $usage de clave."

