#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md#L27
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md:27
msgid ""
"The GDHCN Administrative and Operational Framework should be considered the "
"authoritative source of definitions and concepts in case of any "
"discrepncies."
msgstr ""
"En caso de discrepancia, el Marco para la administración y el funcionamiento"
" de la GDHCN debería considerarse la fuente autorizada de las definiciones y"
" los conceptos."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md#L9
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md:9
msgid ""
"The GDHCN Secretariat manages the Onboarding Process and Letters of "
"Applications of eligible GDHCN Participants to connect as a trusted party to"
" the trust network. Prepared onboarding records will be handed over to the "
"GDHCN Secretariat with the request to process the technical on-boarding of "
"the trusted party. An organizational and technical successful application "
"results in a confirmation and the GDHCN Participant can connect to the trust"
" network as a trusted party."
msgstr ""
"La Secretaría de la GDHCN gestiona el proceso de integración y las Cartas de"
" solicitud de los Participantes cualificados para la GDHCN que desean "
"conectarse a la red de confianza como parte de confianza. Los expedientes de"
" integración preparados se remitirán a la Secretaría de la GDHCN con la "
"solicitud de que tramite la integración técnica de la parte de confianza. "
"Una solicitud satisfactoria desde el punto de vista organizativo y técnico "
"da lugar a una confirmación, y el Participante en la GDHCN puede conectarse "
"a la red de confianza como parte de confianza."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md#L85
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md:85
msgid "the necessary information to connect to the production environment"
msgstr "la información necesaria para conectarse al entorno de producción"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md#L127
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md:127
msgid ""
"The organizational identity and contact will be established in an offline "
"process by WHO through it's Member State country offices with appropriate "
"contacts at ministries of health or appropriate public health agency."
msgstr ""
"La identidad institucional y los datos de contacto se establecerán mediante "
"un proceso fuera de línea por la OMS, a través de sus oficinas en los países"
" de los Estados Miembros, con los contactos adecuados en los ministerios de "
"salud o en el organismo de salud pública competente."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md#L72
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md:72
msgid ""
"The participant needs to [communicate the results] of their tests to us, a "
"quality check about the communicated results will be carried out, so that we"
" can check for any issues or approve their readiness for production rollout."
msgstr ""
"El participante debe [comunicarnos los resultados] de sus pruebas; se "
"llevará a cabo un control de calidad de los resultados comunicados, de modo "
"que podamos detectar posibles problemas o aprobar su preparación para el "
"despliegue en producción."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md#L125
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md:125
msgid ""
"The secretariat must handle the following tasks to establish the on-boarding"
" process:"
msgstr ""
"La Secretaría debe encargarse de las siguientes tareas para establecer el "
"proceso de integración:"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md#L70
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md:70
msgid ""
"The Trust Network Gateway API can be used for interaction keeping the full "
"functionality of the EU DCC Gateway. In addition, various HL7 FHIR services "
"are being added."
msgstr ""
"La API de la puerta de enlace a la red de confianza puede utilizarse para la"
" interacción, manteniendo toda la funcionalidad de la puerta de enlace del "
"DCC de la UE. Además, se están añadiendo diversos servicios de HL7 FHIR."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md#L45
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md:45
msgid ""
"To establish a connection with the Trust Network Gateway (TNG) and become a "
"participant of the GDHCN, the participant is required to prepare their own "
"key materials for us to onboard onto the gateway. This process necessitates "
"technical expertise for the preparation of X.509 certificates, which are to "
"be stored in a GitHub repository owned by the participant for submission."
msgstr ""
"Para establecer una conexión con la puerta de enlace a la red de confianza "
"(TNG) y convertirse en participante de la GDHCN, el participante debe "
"preparar su propio material de claves para que lo integremos en la puerta de"
" enlace. Este proceso requiere conocimientos técnicos especializados para la"
" preparación de certificados X.509, que deben almacenarse en un repositorio "
"de GitHub propiedad del participante para su presentación."

