#. trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md:223
msgid ""
"Copy your GPG key, beginning with -----BEGIN PGP PUBLIC KEY BLOCK----- and "
"ending with -----END PGP PUBLIC KEY BLOCK-----."
msgstr ""
"Copie su clave GPG, que comienza por -----BEGIN PGP PUBLIC KEY BLOCK----- y "
"termina por -----END PGP PUBLIC KEY BLOCK-----."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md#L404
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md:404
msgid ""
"Create a certificate signing request (CSR):In order to create a certificate "
"for a Document Signer, first create a Certificate Signing Request preferably"
" on the machine that will use the certificate in order to avoid copying the "
"private key (DSC01privkey.key) to this machine later. The CSR must contain "
"the Distinguished Name (DN) information that will be included in the DSC. "
"Open a command prompt and use the following command to create the CSR:"
msgstr ""
"Cree una solicitud de firma de certificado (CSR): para crear un certificado "
"para un firmante de documentos, cree primero una solicitud de firma de "
"certificado, preferiblemente en el equipo que utilizará el certificado, a "
"fin de evitar tener que copiar posteriormente la clave privada "
"(DSC01privkey.key) a dicho equipo. La CSR debe contener la información del "
