msgid ""
"Once the confirmation of successful onboarding is received from the TNG "
"Support Team ( gdhcn-support@who.int), please do the following."
msgstr ""
"Una vez recibida del equipo de apoyo de la TNG ( gdhcn-support@who.int) la "
"confirmación de que la integración se ha realizado correctamente, proceda "
"como se indica a continuación."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md#L296
