#. trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md:296
msgid ""
"Once you execute the script. It will generate all certificates and keys in a"
" subfolder named by current datetime."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que ejecute el script, este generará todos los certificados y claves"
" en una subcarpeta con el nombre de la fecha y hora actuales."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md#L912
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md:912
msgid ""
"Once you have a private key to sign with, you can configure Git to use it "
"for signing things by setting the user.signingkey config setting."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que disponga de una clave privada para firmar, puede configurar Git "
"para que la utilice para firmar mediante el parámetro de configuración "
"user.signingkey."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md#L884
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md:884
msgid ""
"Once you receive the CA-signed certificate, you will use it instead of "
"generating a new self-signed certificate. Here’s how you can replace the "
"placeholders with the signed certificate: cp signedCAcert.pem "
"${subdir}/CAcert.pem cp CAprivkey.key ${subdir}/CAprivkey.key"
msgstr ""
"Una vez que reciba el certificado firmado por la CA, lo utilizará en lugar "
"de generar un nuevo certificado autofirmado. A continuación se indica cómo "
"sustituir los marcadores de posición por el certificado firmado: cp "
"signedCAcert.pem ${subdir}/CAcert.pem cp CAprivkey.key "
"${subdir}/CAprivkey.key"

