#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/decision_support.md#L27
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/decision_support.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/decision_support.html
#: input/pagecontent/decision_support.md:27
msgid ""
"Health credentials can be specified using multiple standards. DDCC health "
"credentials, which can be evaluated against CQL business rules, are "
"specified using the Fast Healthcare Interoperability Resources (FHIR) "
"standard. FHIR is a standard that supports the electronic exchange of "
"healthcare information. The FHIR standard is based on common internet "
"standards widely used across industry such as the Hypertext Transfer "
"Protocol (HTTP), JavaScript Object Notation (JSON), representational state "
"transfer (REST), and the Open Authorization (OAuth) standard."
msgstr ""
"Las credenciales de salud pueden especificarse mediante múltiples normas. "
"Las credenciales de salud DDCC, que pueden evaluarse con respecto a reglas "
"de negocio en CQL, se especifican mediante la norma Fast Healthcare "
"Interoperability Resources (FHIR). FHIR es una norma que respalda el "
"intercambio electrónico de información de atención de salud. La norma FHIR "
"se basa en normas comunes de Internet ampliamente utilizadas en el sector, "
"como el Protocolo de Transferencia de Hipertexto (HTTP), la Notación de "
"Objetos de JavaScript (JSON), la transferencia de estado representacional "
"(REST) y la norma Open Authorization (OAuth)."

