"“passports”/“certificates”): Key ethical, legal, and social issues. Policy "
"brief. In: Swiss National COVID-19 Science Task Force [website]. Zurich: ETH"
" Board; 19 February 2021. Last accessed 27 June 2021. What place should "
"COVID-19 vaccine passports have in society?. Ada Lovelace Institute; 17 "
