msgid ""
"ES256 is the primary algorithm ( ) and PS256 the secondary (). Both MUST be "
"implemented even though only one signs any given certificate; the secondary "
"exists so that a break in the primary does not strand the whole network.  "
"MAY instead sit in the unprotected header, and verifiers MUST accept both "
"placements — but when it appears in both, the protected one wins."
msgstr ""
"ES256 es el algoritmo principal ( ) y PS256 el secundario (). Ambos DEBEN "
"implementarse, aunque solo uno firme un certificado determinado; el "
"secundario existe para que una vulneración del principal no deje inoperante "
"a toda la red.  PUEDE figurar en su lugar en el encabezado no protegido, y "
"los verificadores DEBEN aceptar ambas ubicaciones; no obstante, cuando "
"aparezca en ambos, prevalecerá el protegido."

