#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md#L314
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/trust_network_gateway_architecture.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/trust_network_gateway_architecture.html
#: input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md:314
msgid ""
"####### Constraints The TNG may be operated in front with a network "
"component (Load Balancer, API Gateway , Reverse Proxy etc.) which handles "
"the Client Certificate Authentication and Client Certificate Attribute "
"extraction of the TLS connection. After the TLS Offloading it depends on the"
" infrastructure, if an internal secured TLS network must be established or "
"not. For example when the TNG is deployed in a distributed service mesh, "
"it’s recommended to use TLS protected channels e.g. SPIFFE/SPIRE based "
"service meshes. Which mode fits better to the deployment depends on the "
"operators infrastructure. The gateway itself can be operated in a SSL "
"Passthrough mode as well."
msgstr ""
"####### Restricciones La TNG puede funcionar detrás de un componente de red "
"(equilibrador de carga, API Gateway, proxy inverso, etc.) que se encarga de "
"la autenticación mediante certificado de cliente y de la extracción de los "
"atributos del certificado de cliente de la conexión TLS. Tras la descarga de"
" TLS (TLS offloading), depende de la infraestructura si es necesario "
"establecer o no una red TLS interna protegida. Por ejemplo, cuando la TNG se"
" despliega en una malla de servicios distribuida, se recomienda utilizar "
"canales protegidos mediante TLS, por ejemplo, mallas de servicios basadas en"
" SPIFFE/SPIRE. El modo que mejor se adapte al despliegue depende de la "
"infraestructura del operador. La puerta de enlace en sí también puede "
"funcionar en modo de transferencia directa de SSL (SSL Passthrough)."

