#: input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md:176
msgid ""
"Note: All extendedKey usages should be well documented on github to avoid "
"confusion regarding the usage. Each necessary attribute should be set up to "
"support the verification process in the best way."
msgstr ""
"Nota: Todos los usos extendidos de la clave deberían estar debidamente "
"documentados en GitHub para evitar confusiones sobre su uso. Cada atributo "
"necesario debería configurarse de forma que apoye del mejor modo posible el "
"proceso de verificación."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md#L229
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/trust_network_gateway_architecture.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/trust_network_gateway_architecture.html
#: input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md:229
msgid ""
"Note: All routes should filter the delivered content by hash to avoid "
"duplicate content delivery. Two different federations can receive from a "
"single TP the same content in some circumstances."
msgstr ""
"Nota: Todas las rutas deberían filtrar el contenido entregado mediante hash "
"para evitar la entrega de contenido duplicado. En determinadas "
"circunstancias, dos federaciones diferentes pueden recibir el mismo "
"contenido de una misma TP."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md#L115
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/trust_network_gateway_architecture.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/trust_network_gateway_architecture.html
#: input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md:115
msgid ""
"Note: Database Replications have their own behavior and the functionality of"
" the gateway can not cover each available database. Therefore JDBC feature "
"should be used only if necessary and at own risk."
msgstr ""
"Nota: Las replicaciones de bases de datos tienen su propio comportamiento y "
"la funcionalidad de la puerta de enlace no puede abarcar todas las bases de "
"datos disponibles. Por consiguiente, la funcionalidad JDBC solo debería "
"utilizarse cuando sea necesario y por cuenta y riesgo propios."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md#L193
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/trust_network_gateway_architecture.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/trust_network_gateway_architecture.html
#: input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md:193
msgid ""
"Note: Each Federation Route of the Gateway must be configured manually for "
"explicit download, to avoid misunderstandings in configuration. This is "
"important for security reasons. All trust anchors must be onboarded "
"otherwise the content is filtered out."
msgstr ""
"Nota: Cada ruta de federación de la puerta de enlace debe configurarse "
"manualmente para la descarga explícita, a fin de evitar malentendidos en la "
"configuración. Esto es importante por motivos de seguridad. Todas las anclas"
" de confianza deben integrarse; de lo contrario, el contenido se filtra y se"
" descarta."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md#L105
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/trust_network_gateway_architecture.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/trust_network_gateway_architecture.html
#: input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md:105
msgid ""
"Note: The DCC Gateway core architecture remains untouched. Just backwards "
"compatible enhancements will be introduced to support the federation."
msgstr ""
"Nota: La arquitectura central de la puerta de enlace del DCC permanece "
"intacta. Solo se introducirán mejoras compatibles con versiones anteriores "
"para dar soporte a la federación."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md#L146
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/trust_network_gateway_architecture.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/trust_network_gateway_architecture.html
#: input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md:146
msgid ""
"Note: The Federator acts as a special kind of “National Backend”, therefore "
"all TNP associated certificates except the TNPUP will be onboarded normally."
msgstr ""
"Nota: El federador actúa como un tipo especial de «sistema de back-end "
"nacional»; por consiguiente, todos los certificados asociados a TNP, excepto"
" el TNPUP, se integrarán de la forma habitual."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md#L275
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/trust_network_gateway_architecture.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/trust_network_gateway_architecture.html
#: input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md:275
msgid ""
"Note: This new route is introduced to create a migration path to the trusted"
" references. Within EU DCC Standard Mode, there is no backwards "
"compatibility impact."
msgstr ""
"Nota: Esta nueva ruta se introduce para crear una vía de migración hacia las"
" referencias de confianza. En el modo estándar del DCC de la UE, no hay "
"repercusiones en la compatibilidad con versiones anteriores."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
